        "goal_understanding": "The goal is to navigate the piece through each level and step onto every goal cell after matching the goal's required shape, color, and rotation. All goals must be completed to advance and ultimately win the game.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs one stamina, while blocked moves still waste stamina and do not change position. Walls cannot be crossed, so blocked_directions must be checked before every move. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle colors orange \u2192 blue \u2192 green \u2192 red \u2192 orange, and rotation modifiers rotate clockwise through 0\u00b0, 90\u00b0, 180\u00b0, and 270\u00b0. A goal becomes activated when all three attributes match, but it must still be reached and stepped on to complete it. Running out of stamina costs a life and restores stamina to maximum; losing all lives ends the game."
